{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"形式特征"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“形式特征”"},2]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>考虑范畴\n$$\r\n\\mathscr C = \\Big\\{ M \\in \\mathfrak g\\mathsf {-Mod}\\colon  M = \\bigoplus_{\\lambda \\in\\Lambda } M_{\\lambda }, \\dim_{\\mathbb{C}}M_\\lambda &lt;+\\infty \\Big\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$\\operatorname{ch}$</p>\n"}}